('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_12137','aversion','ə''vɝʒn','ə''vɜːʃ(ə)n','[n] 厌恶；讨厌的人','Many people have a natural and emotional aversion to insects.  很多人对昆虫有一种天生的厌恶之感。'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_12138','Hindi','''hindi:','''hindi:','[n] 北印度语; [adj] 北印度的','As well as working on more Hindi films, Hollywood beckons, if only for a new experience.  同样 会为更多的北印度电影配乐，好莱坞也在向他招手——哪怕只是为了有一种新体验。'),
