('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_12155','dictum','''dɪktəm','''dɪktəm','[n] 格言；声明；法官的附带意见','Descartes’ famous dictum: ‘I think; therefore, I am’  笛卡尔的名言 “我思故我在”'),
