('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_12172','hornet','''hɔrnɪt','''hɔːnɪt','[n] [昆] 大黄蜂','The body shell of the Oriental hornet converts sunlight into electricity. Go figure.  东方大黄蜂的身体外壳能把太阳光换转成电能，想想吧！'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_12173','desirous','di''zaiərəs','dɪ''zaɪərəs','[adj] 渴望的；想要的','The enemy is so desirous of peace that he will agree to any terms.  敌人如此渴望和平，他会同意任何条件。'),
