('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_12177','addictive','ə''dɪktɪv','ə''dɪktɪv','[adj] 使人上瘾的','Tobacco is highly addictive .  烟草很容易使人上瘾。'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_12178','maintain','men''ten','meɪn''teɪn; mən''teɪn','[v] 维持；继续；维修；主张；供养','Careers Officers maintain contact with young people when they have left school.  年轻人离开学校以后，职业指导员和他们保持联系。'),
('Level8luan_2','Level8luan_2_12179','minibus','''mɪnɪbʌs','''mɪnɪbʌs','[n] 面包车（等于microbus）；小型公共汽车；中客车; [vi] 乘中客车','He was then taken by minibus to the military base.  接着他被小型公共汽车带到了军事基地。'),
