('Level4_2','Level4_2_620','compassion','kəm''pæʃən','kəm''pæʃ(ə)n','[n] 同情；怜悯','I was shocked by the doctor’s lack of compassion .  我对这个医生如此缺乏同情心感到震惊。'),
