('Level4_2','Level4_2_1602','gravity','''ɡrævəti','''grævɪtɪ','[n] 重力，地心引力；严重性；庄严','the force of gravity  重力'),
('Level4_2','Level4_2_1603','graze','ɡrez','greɪz','[v] 放牧；擦伤; [n] 放牧；轻擦','I fell on the gravel, severely grazing my knee.  我摔倒在砾石路上，膝盖擦伤得很严重。'),
('Level4_2','Level4_2_1604','grease','gris','griːs','[v] 涂脂于；贿赂; [n] 油脂；贿赂','His hair is thick with grease.  他的头发油腻腻的。'),
('Level4_2','Level4_2_1605','greatly','''ɡretli','''greɪtlɪ','[adv] 很，大大地；非常','All offers of help will be greatly appreciated .  如蒙帮助，感激不尽。'),
('Level4_2','Level4_2_1606','Greek','grik','griːk','[n] 希腊语；希腊人; [adj] 希腊的；希腊人的，希腊语的','I had to learn Greek.  我只好学希腊语。'),
('Level4_2','Level4_2_1607','greenhouse','''ɡrinhaʊs','''griːnhaʊs','[n] 温室','But these two countries are responsible for almost half of all greenhouse gas emissions.  但是这两个国家的温室气体排放量几乎占了全世界的一半。'),
('Level4_2','Level4_2_1608','grenade','ɡrə''ned','grə''neɪd','[n] 手榴弹；灭火弹; [vt] 扔手榴弹；用催泪弹攻击','a hand grenade  手榴弹'),
('Level4_2','Level4_2_1609','greyhound','','','[n] 灰狗（一种猎犬）；快速船','I didn''t fly. I took the Greyhound.  我没有乘飞机。我乘的是灰狗巴士。'),
('Level4_2','Level4_2_1610','grief','ɡrif','griːf','[n] 悲痛；忧伤；不幸','Every change in our lives brings with it griefs.  我们生活当中的每一个变化都有让人伤心的一面。'),
('Level4_2','Level4_2_1611','grim','ɡrɪm','grɪm','[adj] 冷酷的；糟糕的；残忍的; [n] (Grim)人名；(英、德、俄、捷、匈)格里姆','The weather forecast is pretty grim.  天气预报说天气很恶劣。'),
