('Level4_2','Level4_2_1655','hardly','''hɑrdli','''hɑːdlɪ','[adv] 几乎不，简直不；刚刚','My parents divorced when I was six, and I hardly knew my father.  我六岁时父母离婚，我对父亲几乎一无所知。'),
('Level4_2','Level4_2_1656','hare','hɛr','heə','[n] 野兔','Because it makes its home in an extreme environment, the desert hare is biologically designed to radiate excess heat through its lanky limbs and oversized ears.  因为生长在极端环境中，沙漠兔子形成了独特的生物学构造，通过瘦长的四肢和超大的耳朵辐射多余的热量。'),
('Level4_2','Level4_2_1657','harmless','''hɑrmləs','''hɑ:mləs','[adj] 无害的；无恶意的','Her brother’s a bit simple, but he’s quite harmless.  她的弟弟有点愚钝，不过他决不会伤害别人。'),
