('Level4_2','Level4_2_2627','pornography','pɔr''nɑɡrəfi','pɔː''nɒgrəfɪ','[n] 色情文学；色情描写','The country''s leading newspaper has called for a new campaign against child pornography.  该国最大的报纸已呼吁开展一场新运动反对儿童色情作品。'),
