('Level4_2','Level4_2_3201','significance','sɪɡ''nɪfɪkəns','sɪg''nɪfɪk(ə)ns','[n] 意义；重要性；意思','Ideas about the social significance of religion have changed over time.  有关宗教的社会意义的观念已随时间的流逝发生了改变。'),
('Level4_2','Level4_2_3202','signpost','''saɪnpost','''saɪnpəʊst','[n] 路标；指示牌','I’m sure that signpost is pointing the wrong way.  我敢肯定那块路标指错了方向。'),
('Level4_2','Level4_2_3203','silent','''saɪlənt','''saɪlənt','[adj] 沉默的；寂静的；无记载的; [n] 无声电影','The large house was silent and lonely.  这幢大房子寂静荒凉。'),
